{"page":126,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:109","surah":5,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَوْمَ يَجْمَعُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلرُّسُلَ فَيَقُولُ مَاذَآ أُجِبْتُمْ ۖ قَالُوا۟ لَا عِلْمَ لَنَآ ۖ إِنَّكَ أَنتَ عَلَّـٰمُ ٱلْغُيُوبِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day when God assembles all the messengers and asks, ‘What response did you receive?’ they will say, ‘We do not have that knowledge: You alone know things that cannot be seen.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَجْمَعُ","en_gloss":"will (be) gathered","transliteration":"yajmaʿu","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلَ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusula","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"and He will say","transliteration":"fayaqūlu","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَاذَآ","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mādhā","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أُجِبْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"was (the) response you received","transliteration":"ujib'tum","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِلْمَ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'ma","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَنَآ ۖ","en_gloss":"for us","transliteration":"lanā","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed You","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"You","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عَلَّـٰمُ","en_gloss":"(are the) Knower","transliteration":"ʿallāmu","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْغُيُوبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the unseen","transliteration":"l-ghuyūbi","verse_key":"5:109"},{"pos":16,"ar":"١٠٩","en_gloss":"(109)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:109"}]},{"verse_key":"5:110","surah":5,"ayah":110,"ar_uthmani":"إِذْ قَالَ ٱللَّهُ يَـٰعِيسَى ٱبْنَ مَرْيَمَ ٱذْكُرْ نِعْمَتِى عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ وَٰلِدَتِكَ إِذْ أَيَّدتُّكَ بِرُوحِ ٱلْقُدُسِ تُكَلِّمُ ٱلنَّاسَ فِى ٱلْمَهْدِ وَكَهْلًا ۖ وَإِذْ عَلَّمْتُكَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ ۖ وَإِذْ تَخْلُقُ مِنَ ٱلطِّينِ كَهَيْـَٔةِ ٱلطَّيْرِ بِإِذْنِى فَتَنفُخُ فِيهَا فَتَكُونُ طَيْرًۢا بِإِذْنِى ۖ وَتُبْرِئُ ٱلْأَكْمَهَ وَٱلْأَبْرَصَ بِإِذْنِى ۖ وَإِذْ تُخْرِجُ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ بِإِذْنِى ۖ وَإِذْ كَفَفْتُ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ عَنكَ إِذْ جِئْتَهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ فَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ إِنْ هَـٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحْرٌ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Then God will say, ‘Jesus, son of Mary! Remember My favour to you and to your mother: how I strengthened you with the holy spirit, so that you spoke to people in your infancy and as a grown man; how I taught you the Scripture and wisdom, the Torah and the Gospel; how, by My leave, you fashioned the shape of a bird out of clay, breathed into it, and it became, by My leave, a bird; how, by My leave, you healed the blind person and the leper; how, by My leave, you brought the dead back to life; how I restrained the Children of Israel from [harming] you when you brought them clear signs, and those of them who disbelieved said, “This is clearly nothing but sorcery”;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَـٰعِيسَى","en_gloss":"O Isa","transliteration":"yāʿīsā","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱبْنَ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ib'na","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"maryama","verse_key":"5:110"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱذْكُرْ","en_gloss":"Remember","transliteration":"udh'kur","verse_key":"5:110